      "excerpt": "APHA Chinese name: 亚太艺术疗愈联盟 English descriptor: Asia Pacific Healing Arts Alliance Brand Role APHA is an Asia Pacific arts and healing alliance IP for creative wellbeing, therapeutic arts, and cross cultural care practices. Visual Direction Temperament: restorative, humane, professional, warm, spacious. Color cues: mineral blue, sage green, clay, warm ivory. Imagery cues: gentle movement, art practice, natural textur",
      "text": "# APHA\n\nChinese name: 亚太艺术疗愈联盟\n\nEnglish descriptor: Asia-Pacific Healing Arts Alliance\n\n## Brand Role\n\nAPHA is an Asia-Pacific arts and healing alliance IP for creative wellbeing, therapeutic arts, and cross-cultural care practices.\n\n## Visual Direction\n\n- Temperament: restorative, humane, professional, warm, spacious.\n- Color cues: mineral blue, sage green, clay, warm ivory.\n- Imagery cues: gentle movement, art practice, natural textures, care circles, regional cultural exchange.\n\n## Agent Notes\n\n- Use `亚太艺术疗愈联盟` as the Chinese IP name.\n- Use `APHA` as the public IP shorthand.\n- Keep the visual system calm and trustworthy, with enough warmth to avoid clinical coldness.\n"
    }
